  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 303.17 Professional Geologist. Plans, calculations, and other documents requiring the practice of geology as defined in RSA 310-A:118, III shall be sealed by a qualified professional geologist.\n\nSource. #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
